# Post-battle briefing.
<machine_speech><gray>Battle log — outcome: <shining>{result}<\shining>. Duration {ticks} ticks. Own losses {lost}. Enemy destroyed {killed}. Fleet strength {ships}.<\gray>
?if result = victory
<gray>It read the board and was read in turn. A sub with a fortress beside it is a cheaper bait than it looks.<\gray>
?else
<gray>It struck a sub you had emptied. Its threshold falls the more of your fleet it sees in flight.<\gray>
?end
?if lost = 0
<golden><shining>It never found an opening.<\golden><\shining>
?end
<blue>Source of adversary: <shining>evolution cluster, lineage 0<\shining>. Further lineages are queued.<\blue>
